   "class": "wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 638,
   "text": "To make trips to Mars affordable, the rocket has to be reusable, which means this thing has to land. So SpaceX got busy innovating, designing a system to catch the landing rocket between two giant arms. Last week, SpaceX announced that on Sunday, October 13, they would perform Starship’s fifth test launch and, for the first time, attempt to catch the gargantuan rocket on the way down.\nI knew one t",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 4,
    "repeats": 4,
    "coverLinks": 0
